              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Always generated fresh (never served from stored CoverageApplicationPDF\nrecords, which may predate the latest answers) so the preview matches\nwhat GenerateApplicationPDFService attaches to the underwriter\nsubmission email at send time. Returned inline so the browser can\nrender it rather than download it."
